  TirePressurePageModel.kt      framework-free: TirePressurePageRegistration, TirePressureReading/Summary/Snapshot,
                                parseTirePressureLatest/History, normaliseTpmsToPa (raw->Pa), pressureStatus/gaugeTier/
                                statusTone, hasTpmsWarning, sortReadings, TireDisplayPrefs (displayValue/pressureText/
                                pressureWithUnit/count/dateTime via convertPressureFromSI), recordTirePressureOpened,
                                mapData. JVM-unit-testable.
  TirePressurePageSource.kt     seam + tirePressurePageSourceOf(vehicleSystemsStore, settingsStore, selectedVehicleStore).
  TirePressurePageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel: state StateFlow<UiState<TirePressureSnapshot>> (combine latest+history,
                                page phase follows latest), displayPrefs, refresh/retry/recordViewOpened.
  TirePressurePageIcons.kt      TireGlyphs: Gauge/AlertTriangle/TrendingDown/Activity/Clock/AlertCircle authored locally
                                as 24x24 stroked vectors (web lucide icons), tinted at render.
  TirePressurePage.kt           stateless Compose render layer: chrome (title/subtitle/freshness/VehicleSelect/banners) +
                                snapshot-gated body (loader/error/9 panels) + 4 RadialGauges + LineChart wrapper +
                                sortable DataTable.
  TirePressurePageHost.kt       PageHosts.register("tirePressure") for the /tire-pressure destination.
  res/values/tire_pressure_strings.xml  app-owned literal-key labels absent from the generated translation_* catalog
